5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like for people! I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane and the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think we should be careful about the costs. I'll look into the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's see why people are complaining. I'll check the ward complaint log and the statements at the residents' meeting.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm worried about the workload. I'll look into the truck arrival time and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be fair about the space. I'll check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
