55,3,1,talk,Rin,,I vote for Rotating Location! No smelly houses!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Midori,,I'll vote for Rotating Location too. It avoids the high cost of a shelter.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Rotating Location it is. It's the best way to keep the peace.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,I vote Rotating Location. It spreads the effort.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,I vote Rotating Location. It's the fairest option available.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
